  "description": "ZIRJOB crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c a. Reported CIF formula moiety: 0.8(C64 H64 Cu4 N12 O40 Y4),6(C1 H4 O1),0.2(C66 H68 Cu4 N12 O40 Y4). From the CIF bond table, Y1 (Y) has 9 O neighbors; Y2 (Y) has 9 O neighbors; Cu1 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors; Cu2 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors; Y3 (Y) has 9 O neighbors; Y4 (Y) has 9 O neighbors; Cu3 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors; Cu4 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.474-3.983 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.28-111.53°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Cu4Y4(vanox)6(Hvanox)2(NO3)4(μ-OH2)1.6(μ-HOMe)0.4]·6MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
